    "(4.1), (A.1)-(A.4), (B.1)-(B.11)); Problem 1, Lemmas 3.2, 3.3, 3.7-3.10, Theorems 3.4-3.6, Corollary 3.11, Remarks 3.1 "
    "and 3.12 and the seven proofs carry their printed labels in bold. Algorithms 3.1-3.3 are image crops plus transcriptions; "
    "Figures 1-3 are image crops (edges checked on wider renders) with verbatim captions; Table 1 is a CSV read on a 250-dpi "
