    {"file": P, "heading": "2.2. Christoffel Functions", "purpose": "Christoffel function, moment matrix, empirical inverse Christoffel function (2.3), matrix-inversion form (2.4)-(2.5), kernelized version (2.6)-(2.7), Footnote 1"},
